<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Admin MOTD is one of the server administration windows. Open it from File > Admin; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_save}>{dgettext("help_features", "Setting it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The pane at the top shows the message that is set right now, so you can see what you are about to replace. Set MOTD writes the editor's contents; submitting an empty editor is the same as clearing."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_trash}>{dgettext("help_features", "Clearing it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Clear MOTD removes it entirely — users connecting afterwards see no message of the day until one is set again."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Access")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Only server administrators may edit. Server operators can read the current message but the editor and both write buttons are disabled."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">
    {dgettext("help_features", "admin console")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-motd">{dgettext("help_features", "/motd")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-setmotd">{dgettext("help_features", "/setmotd")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-clearmotd">{dgettext("help_features", "/clearmotd")}</.help_link>
</p>
